    "url": "https://media.wizards.com/2026/downloads/MagicCompRules%2020260925.txt",
    "rules": "Frozen Oracle requires one trigger for a simultaneous placement on one or more other controlled Hero permanents, including noncreature Heroes. The pinned XMage class observes recipient-specific COUNTERS_ADDED (CardImpl.addCounters emits it per recipient; TriggeredAbilities.checkTrigger queues each event independently), so Rust deliberately dispatches once for the whole simultaneous batch. The optional token belongs to the captured trigger controller, with no intervening-if recheck. CR 603.2c dispatches once per trigger event; 122.6 and 122.6a include counters placed as part of entering. CR 603.10 uses post-event characteristics except specified look-back events. GameImpl.addTriggeredAbility copies each occurrence with a fresh ID and GameState appends it, confirming that no batch deduplication repairs the Java per-recipient observer."
  }
